(F1)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t  Camera Control</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t     Zoom In to the combat original</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t Zoom out to take in the whole Battlefield</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t Pan left and right</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t Pan up and down</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t Pan to HQ, (HOME key)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t\t Pan to Squad Selection, (enabled in pause menu)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t  Autosave - After completing each level the game will autosave and unlock the next level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t  Conquest the Next level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\t  Replay any level that has been unlocked<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910630/extras/3a1ec9494ee4806e8e8a688d4af5ba2d.avif?t=1755784441\" width=648 height=458 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3910630/extras/Simple_Combat?t=1755784441\" /></span></p>",
